Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:57:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 33/42] drm/amdgpu: retain tested M1 non-posted mapping and I/O
 adaptations

Experimental exact Test63 source snapshot, including diagnostic phase logging. Mapping and I/O-copy approaches derive from Joshua Warren linux-aurora PR188 patches 2, 3 and 6; GFX11 staging adapted to GFX10. Imported patches 4, 5 and 7 retain their original authors in preceding commits. AI-assisted development; no claim of upstream readiness.
